<title>BELGIUM: AXA-UAP has 3.00% of UCB.</title>
<headline>AXA-UAP has 3.00% of UCB.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurance group AXA-UAP has built up a three percent stake in Belgian drugs and chemicals group UCB, the Brussels bourse said on Friday in a transparency statement in Belgian newspapers.</p>
<p>The stake is held 1.02 percent through Belgian insurance company Royale Belge and 1.26 percent through  AXA Belgium, which recently merged with its French parent.</p>
<p>Other interests are held through numerous AXA-UAP units.</p>
<p>It was the group's first statement on its holdings in UCB.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
